WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.190
GoodStream has built the first comprehensive
agentic AI harness for private capital.

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:09.000
So what does that mean for you,
as the CFO of a venture firm?

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:14.160
One of your portfolio companies just
got an offer to sell for $180 million.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.890
Congratulations.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:19.180
Now, what does your fund actually get?

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.470
Ownership math says $30 million.

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:23.210
The charter disagrees.

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:30.270
The answer is one clause, buried in your
financing documents, charters and cap tables.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:33.750
GoodStream reads, processes
and extracts all of it.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:38.670
Specialized agents check each other's work,
and a person settles every disagreement.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:44.100
Type any exit, and watch it flow through the
preference stack to every fund and holder.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.180
Series C takes its preference.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:47.840
Series B converts.

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:51.490
Drag the price, and see
exactly where each class flips.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:59.170
Come quarter-end, no re-keying, and
no rebuilding the audit file by hand.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:03.640
Every input is sourced, and the valuation
bridge is drafted for your sign-off.

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:07.260
Click any number for its source
clause, and who checked it.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:11.440
Nothing is verified until
it ties out to your records.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:17.600
We've completed a SOC 2 Type 2 examination,
and LLMs will never train on your data.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:23.930
See what the first comprehensive agentic AI
harness for private capital can do for your firm.

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:24.965
GoodStream.

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:27.710
Know every position, every day.

